Owner: Store Manager / HSE (VS-24.3) / DG (VS-114)
Participants: HSE (VS-24.3), DG (VS-114), Store Ops (VS-07), Merchandising (VS-01), Customer Safety, IFM (VS-138)
Source: workflow W4397 — Chemical, Paint &amp; Hazmat Customer Exposure Control (In-Store)</bpmn:documentation>
