        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Merchandising/HSE control customer-accessible chemical placement — ventilation, secondary containment, separation of incompatibles, child-resistant where required, restricted-access for high-hazard, SDS accessibility (links VS-137)
Responsible (R): Merchandising / HSE / Customer Safety
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising / HSE Lead
Duration: Per assortment/change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4397_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4397_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
