        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Store team manage in-store chemical spills/exposure (spill kit, ventilation, customer first-aid/eyewash, evacuation if needed), contain, and report (W4401/W4405)
Responsible (R): Store Ops / HSE / First Aider
Accountable (A): Store Manager / HSE Lead
Duration: Per incident</bpmn:documentation>
