        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Visual Merch/HSE specify the safety-signage &amp; wayfinding standard — wet-floor, watch-your-step, forklift-in-area, hard-hat-zone (yard), no-climb, emergency-exit, restroom/PWD, chemical-area — per zone (W4389)
Responsible (R): Visual Merch / HSE / Customer Safety
Accountable (A): Head of Customer Safety / VP Visual Merch
