Responsible (R): IFM / Visual Merch
Accountable (A): IFM Lead
Duration: Per schedule/defect</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4398_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4398_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
