    <bpmn:process id="W_W4399" name="W4399. Crowding, Queue &amp; Peak-Period (Sale-Event) Customer Safety" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Sale event (VS-01/VS-14); peak (payday/weekend/holiday); doorbuster
Frequency: Per event + recurring peaks
Volume: ~6 major catalog sales/yr + monthly hot-deals + holiday peaks (ber-months, paydays) × 200 stores
Owner: Store Manager / Marketing (VS-14) / Loss Prevention (VS-23)
Participants: Marketing (VS-14), Store Ops (VS-07), Loss Prevention (VS-23), Security, HSE (VS-24), Customer Safety
Source: workflow W4399 — Crowding, Queue &amp; Peak-Period (Sale-Event) Customer Safety</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4399_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4399_Lane1" name="Marketing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4399_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4399_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4399_Lane2" name="Store Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4399_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4399_Lane3" name="HSE">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4399_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4399_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4399_Start5" name="Sale event (VS-01/VS-14); peak (payday/weekend/holiday); doorbuster">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4399_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4399_Task6" name="Marketing/Store forecast peak volume, assess crowd risk (entry queue…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Marketing/Store forecast peak volume, assess crowd risk (entry queue, doorbuster stampede, capacity-vs-occupancy), and plan crowd-management (queue marshals, entry metering, stanchions, security) per BFP assembly-occupancy
Responsible (R): Marketing / Store / Loss Prevention / HSE
Accountable (A): Store Manager / Marketing Lead / LP Lead
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4399_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4399_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4399_Task7" name="Store/LP execute crowd control on the day — entry metering, queue routing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Store/LP execute crowd control on the day — entry metering, queue routing, occupancy monitoring, hotspot staffing, ready-response team — and stop/adjust on density threshold
Responsible (R): Store Ops / Loss Prevention / Security
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4399_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4399_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4399_Task8" name="HSE/Customer Safety review each peak for incidents/near-misses (W4402), capture…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: HSE/Customer Safety review each peak for incidents/near-misses (W4402), capture learning, and improve the next event&#x27;s plan (W4404)
Responsible (R): HSE / Customer Safety / Marketing
Accountable (A): Head of Customer Safety / Marketing Lead
Duration: Post-event</bpmn:documentation>
