Owner: Store Manager / Customer Safety / CX (VS-13)
Participants: CX (VS-13), Store Ops (VS-07), HSE (VS-24), IFM (VS-138), Mandatory Discount (VS-85), Customer Safety
Source: workflow W4400 — Vulnerable-Customer (PWD/Senior/Child) Safety &amp; Accommodation</bpmn:documentation>
