        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Store team provide assistance (priority service, carry-out, cart-escort, restroom access), maintain accessible routes/fixtures, and watch for at-risk customers (unaccompanied child, mobility-impaired in yard)
Responsible (R): Store Ops / Sales Associates
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4400_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4400_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4400_Task8" name="IFM maintain accessibility fixtures (ramps, handrails, accessible restroom, PWD…">
