Responsible (R): IFM / CX / Customer Safety
Accountable (A): IFM Lead / CX Lead
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4400_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4400_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
